---
description: Vue 3 Inertia page conventions for this CRM
globs: "**/*.vue"
alwaysApply: false
---

- script setup only. Pages in resources/js/Pages/. Shared UI in resources/js/Components/. Layouts in resources/js/Layouts/.
- Internal navigation uses Inertia Link. Forms use useForm from @inertiajs/vue3.
- Import app code with the @/ alias.
- Do not enforce permissions only by hiding buttons.
- Required fields show a red asterisk. Destructive actions use a confirm dialog.
- Desktop forms are two columns. Viewports from 320px up must remain usable.
- No Salesforce logo, name, or proprietary font.
- No raw hex and no inline color or font styles in Vue. Use token classes from the global CSS theme.
